The '''swaggiest stairs ever''' is an [[April Fools' Day jokes|April Fools' joke]] [[block]]. It is a [[netherite block]] variant of [[stairs]], added in [[Java Edition 20w14∞]].

== Obtaining ==
The swaggiest stairs ever is available in the [[Creative inventory]], and naturally generates in the "{{code|missing}}" dimension. It is also seen in other dimensions, one of them being the "{{code|gallery}}" dimension.

=== Breaking ===
The swaggiest stairs ever drops itself if mined with a [[diamond pickaxe]] or better. If mined with any other tool, it drops nothing.
{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Swaggiest stairs ever|Pickaxe|Diamond|hidecopper=1}}

=== Natural generation ===
The swaggiest stairs ever naturally generates in the "{{code|missing}}" dimension as the stairs leading up to the chest containing the [[footprint]]s. 7 stairs generate here.

